# Repository Architecture (REV.3 FINAL)

**Rule:** UI는 SessionStorage/Oracle **직접 호출 금지** → `getRepositories()`

**Config:** `src/config/repositoryArchitecture.js` · **Impl:** `src/repositories/`

```text
V1.0: React UI → Repository → SessionStorage (가상 MES)
V1.1: React UI → Repository → Oracle
```

**Primary Key:** `mesManagementNo` (MES 관리번호 · 예: DL260702-016)

**Repositories:** Customer · Product · Incoming · Inspection · Certificate (+ 확장)

**Swap policy:** UI · Workflow **불변** · Repository 구현만 교체
